<title>CHINA: China wheat imports up 16 pct in Jan-Aug - customs.</title>
<headline>China wheat imports up 16 pct in Jan-Aug - customs.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's imports of wheat rose by 16 percent in the first eight months of the year to total 6.08 million tonnes, customs figures showed on Saturday.</p>
<p>The figures gave no more details.</p>
</text>
